  "body": "Step 6 at:\r\n\r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#fetch-a-single-module-script\r\n\r\nSays:\r\n\r\n> If destination is \"worker\" or \"sharedworker\" and the top-level module fetch flag is set, then set request's mode to \"same-origin\".\r\n\r\n\r\nShould this be updated to include the \"serviceworker\" destination to be consistent?  Service workers have a separate same-origin check in the spec, but it would be nice to have this additional safety.  Also, its observably different because of the Origin header being sent, etc.",
